WEBVTT

00:01.395 --> 00:03.725
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.835 --> 00:06.895
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.365 --> 00:10.105
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.105 --> 00:14.765
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.175 --> 00:22.175
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.885 --> 00:26.755
Dragon Drive

00:26.755 --> 00:32.285
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.395 --> 00:35.365
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.365 --> 00:38.625
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.105 --> 00:43.475
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.475 --> 00:45.445
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.445 --> 00:51.775
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.485 --> 00:55.855
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.855 --> 00:59.085
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.385 --> 01:04.395
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.395 --> 01:05.985
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.095 --> 01:08.495
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.495 --> 01:11.665
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.035 --> 01:17.105
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.105 --> 01:19.845
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.845 --> 01:27.545
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:39.895 --> 01:41.195
That's the Den of Goshoh!

01:43.765 --> 01:44.755
Chibi!

01:55.615 --> 01:56.775
You can do it, Chibi!

02:06.385 --> 02:08.375
Senkohcoola!

02:13.095 --> 02:16.225
Dragonic Heaven

02:16.635 --> 02:18.895
To think that you defeated Goshoh.

02:19.505 --> 02:22.495
It is no surprise that you are the warrior
chosen by Senkohcoola.

02:24.035 --> 02:26.095
That was really nothing.

02:27.045 --> 02:28.735
Don't you get cocky!

02:29.775 --> 02:33.505
Ow, ow, ow!

02:33.685 --> 02:35.145
What do you think you're doing?!

02:35.415 --> 02:37.575
You really don't have a clue, do you?!

02:37.685 --> 02:38.525
What do you mean?

02:38.525 --> 02:41.125
We don't have time for this!

02:41.125 --> 02:42.625
- Why not?!
- Elder.

02:42.625 --> 02:45.555
- Just get your act together, will you?!
- Yes, I am convinced now.

02:45.965 --> 02:49.295
You will no doubt achieve victory
at the Dragonic Heaven...

02:49.535 --> 02:51.725
...and be able to protect the Dragonite.

02:53.065 --> 02:54.535
Dr-Dra-Dragonic what?

02:54.975 --> 02:56.235
Victory?

02:56.435 --> 02:57.965
Do you not know?

02:58.075 --> 03:00.545
They have only just arrived in Rikyu.

03:00.905 --> 03:02.245
I have not spoken to them about it yet.

03:02.415 --> 03:03.465
Uh-huh!

03:04.245 --> 03:05.645
Is that so?

03:06.685 --> 03:07.885
Then I shall tell you.

03:07.885 --> 03:09.875
The Dragonic Heaven.

03:10.915 --> 03:15.895
Each country in Rikyu sends
its best Dragon Drivers to form a team...

03:15.895 --> 03:18.565
...and enter a tournament
to determine who is the strongest.

03:18.565 --> 03:20.495
That is the Dragonic Heaven!

03:20.795 --> 03:24.705
And only those who achieve victory
at the Dragonic Heaven...

03:24.705 --> 03:26.765
...may lay their eyes upon the holy treasure.

03:26.765 --> 03:28.465
That is, the Dragonite.

03:30.505 --> 03:34.905
RI-ON will surely send a team
as part of its quest to capture the Stone.

03:35.315 --> 03:37.775
The only way to prevent RI-ON
from taking the Dragonite...

03:37.775 --> 03:40.715
...is to take part in the Dragonic Heaven
tournament and achieve victory.

03:41.115 --> 03:42.445
There you have it.

03:42.685 --> 03:44.015
Do you understand now?

03:45.925 --> 03:47.255
Meguru, make the arrangements.

03:48.155 --> 03:49.255
Wait a minute!

03:49.255 --> 03:51.195
You can't make decisions for us!

03:51.465 --> 03:55.595
Who said that we'd be willing to cooperate
with people we don't even know, like you?!

03:56.065 --> 03:58.035
You must cooperate with us.

03:58.665 --> 04:01.725
Do you children wish to return
to your own world?

04:02.035 --> 04:03.095
Of course!

04:04.205 --> 04:07.265
In that case, you must win
at the Dragonic Heaven!

04:07.575 --> 04:09.875
Don't change the subject like that!

04:13.215 --> 04:16.415
There's no other way
for you to get back to your world.

04:18.155 --> 04:21.425
The Jigen Joker that brought you
to this world...

04:21.425 --> 04:24.755
...has used up all of its power
and has fallen into a deep sleep.

04:25.895 --> 04:28.455
In order to send you back to your world...

04:28.765 --> 04:35.065
...we must use the Dragonite's power
to revive the Jigen Joker.

04:35.835 --> 04:37.205
In other words...

04:37.775 --> 04:39.375
...we have no choice...

04:39.375 --> 04:42.935
...but to go to this Dragonic Heaven thing
and take part in the tournament?

04:44.815 --> 04:45.745
W-Wait a minute!

04:46.215 --> 04:50.955
There's no guarantee that we'll be able to win
at the Dragonic Heaven!

04:50.955 --> 04:51.885
Don't worry!

04:53.155 --> 04:54.585
You are strong!

04:54.955 --> 04:56.115
I know it!

04:56.325 --> 04:58.655
W-What are you basing this belief on?

04:58.965 --> 05:00.455
Don't be so irresponsible!

05:02.195 --> 05:04.255
What're you going to do, Reiji?

05:11.775 --> 05:13.005
Um...

05:33.865 --> 05:35.725
Elder.

05:40.235 --> 05:45.605
Take your "penance" and shove it!

05:57.515 --> 06:00.015
The same as always, huh?

06:14.835 --> 06:18.065
You can't hide anything from me.

06:37.355 --> 06:38.915
What's he doing?

06:39.065 --> 06:40.965
Running around in circles like that.

06:41.435 --> 06:44.765
Reiji has a habit of doing that
when he's in deep thought about something.

06:44.965 --> 06:49.665
He runs around in circles like an idiot
whenever he's troubled by something.

06:49.805 --> 06:51.675
Not "like an idiot", he is an idiot.

06:53.075 --> 06:55.975
I wonder what Reiji plans on doing.

07:04.085 --> 07:07.145
Don't worry. You will get stronger.

07:10.225 --> 07:15.255
Dragon Drive is a game designed
to train warriors to fight for RI-ON.

07:18.765 --> 07:22.165
So you're the warrior
who was chosen by Senkohcoola?

07:28.345 --> 07:29.775
That's enough for me.

07:33.315 --> 07:34.305
Chibi.

07:35.255 --> 07:38.875
I just can't believe that Miss L
could be one of the bad guys.

07:39.385 --> 07:42.555
But it doesn't seem like the people here
are lying, either.

07:42.925 --> 07:44.655
Who am I supposed to believe?

07:45.025 --> 07:47.995
I have no idea what it is
that I'm supposed to do.

07:49.665 --> 07:53.065
Chibi, what do you think I should do?

07:53.235 --> 07:57.065
All I wanted
was to get stronger with you.

07:58.905 --> 08:01.305
But look what's happened now!

08:02.215 --> 08:04.775
Ahh! What am I supposed to do?!

08:06.745 --> 08:07.945
Are you still unsure?

08:08.955 --> 08:09.935
Huh?

08:24.265 --> 08:25.965
Really, Grandfather?

08:25.965 --> 08:28.625
Does this treasure really exist?

08:29.235 --> 08:31.335
Yes, it does.

08:31.975 --> 08:33.465
In another world.

08:33.905 --> 08:36.105
On the other Earth.

08:36.645 --> 08:37.945
There you will find...

08:38.215 --> 08:42.175
...a power that can grant any wish
that you may have.

08:42.815 --> 08:44.715
I will be sure to go there!

08:44.715 --> 08:47.985
And I'll bring back the treasure!

08:48.625 --> 08:51.455
So you need not worry, Grandfather!

08:53.725 --> 08:57.495
It seems that Grandfather's story was true,
after all.

08:59.265 --> 09:01.665
A power that can grant any wish.

09:02.005 --> 09:03.735
It will be mine!

09:07.005 --> 09:11.535
The existence of RI-ON is known
only to Meguru and a few others.

09:12.785 --> 09:15.715
Their organization will soon grow
into something gargantuan.

09:15.715 --> 09:17.585
We must make a move before this happens.

09:17.955 --> 09:19.785
E-Ensui!

09:23.495 --> 09:25.325
What is it, Komaki?

09:25.325 --> 09:26.485
Why all this noise?

09:26.595 --> 09:28.125
Y-You see...

09:28.125 --> 09:31.325
...t-that man has escaped the dungeon!

09:31.665 --> 09:32.655
What?!

09:41.005 --> 09:43.305
Where's the elder?!

09:43.775 --> 09:45.215
R-Rockaku!

09:45.415 --> 09:48.675
You were ordered to remain underground
in the dungeon as penance!

09:48.985 --> 09:50.645
Shut your noise hole!

09:50.955 --> 09:54.185
I'm not here to talk about that!

09:54.185 --> 09:55.715
Hey, Elder!

09:55.925 --> 09:59.295
I hear I'm not allowed
to compete in the Dragonic Heaven.

09:59.295 --> 10:01.155
What's this all about, then?!

10:01.395 --> 10:02.385
You idiot!

10:03.135 --> 10:05.735
You become mad with drink
and rampage all over the place.

10:05.735 --> 10:07.755
You go about picking fights with anyone!

10:08.205 --> 10:11.005
A wild beast like you is unworthy
to take part in the tournament!

10:11.575 --> 10:13.905
I am the strongest!

10:14.075 --> 10:15.505
You got a problem with that?!

10:17.175 --> 10:18.915
Unfortunately for you...

10:18.915 --> 10:21.905
...I've already found a great warrior
to enter the tournament.

10:23.515 --> 10:24.845
What?

10:27.155 --> 10:29.315
I loved Dragon Drive as well.

10:29.595 --> 10:31.565
I used to play it almost every day.

10:31.565 --> 10:33.185
R-Right.

10:33.595 --> 10:36.595
After a while,
I was told there was a secret bonus game...

10:36.595 --> 10:38.655
...and I was brought here to Rikyu.

10:39.105 --> 10:41.805
Of course, I believed that it was only a game.

10:41.805 --> 10:45.565
I didn't think anything of it
and I followed every order RI-ON gave me.

10:56.155 --> 10:59.645
But I made one mistake
that resulted in a serious injury.

11:00.625 --> 11:04.285
And it was the people of this town
who rescued me and took care of me.

11:05.025 --> 11:08.055
The elder, Ensui, was very kind to me.

11:08.365 --> 11:11.595
That's when I first realized
that I'd been deceived by Dragon Drive.

11:12.065 --> 11:14.295
That I'd been deceived by RI-ON.

11:15.435 --> 11:17.305
Is that right?

11:19.075 --> 11:23.065
I love this town and the people who live here.

11:23.875 --> 11:28.215
That's why I want to save this place,
Rikyu, from RI-ON.

11:32.655 --> 11:35.555
Please, Reiji, I need your strength!

11:35.555 --> 11:38.115
F-F-F-Fine...

11:41.065 --> 11:43.465
That's enough!

11:44.635 --> 11:45.605
Meguru!

11:45.835 --> 11:48.925
How dare you try to convince him
with your womanly wiles?!

11:53.175 --> 11:54.805
Uh, no! It's not!

11:54.975 --> 11:57.275
Yeah! It's not what you think at all, Maiko!

11:57.445 --> 12:00.675
What's "not what I think at all"?
Go ahead, speak up!

12:01.185 --> 12:03.415
What Meguru's saying is the truth.

12:04.085 --> 12:07.715
I can feel how much
she really wants to save this world.

12:09.095 --> 12:10.055
Reiji?

12:10.825 --> 12:12.015
Reiji.

12:14.695 --> 12:17.025
Hey, you guys! Get out of here quickly!

12:17.535 --> 12:18.625
Gokaku!

12:18.865 --> 12:19.835
What do you mean?

12:21.905 --> 12:23.665
My older brother's looking for you guys.

12:24.275 --> 12:26.745
And he'll kill you if he finds you.

12:27.245 --> 12:29.335
Older brother?

12:39.785 --> 12:41.125
Just get out of here!

12:41.125 --> 12:43.095
My brother will kill you if he finds you.

12:44.825 --> 12:45.695
Older brother?

12:56.435 --> 12:59.635
So, are you Reiji Ozora?

13:00.045 --> 13:02.135
I'm asking if you're Reiji Ozora!

13:02.275 --> 13:05.005
No! No! No! No! No! That's him!

13:06.485 --> 13:07.145
Me?

13:08.715 --> 13:09.705
Right.

13:20.765 --> 13:22.855
Um...

13:28.335 --> 13:31.135
You're going to fight me, Reiji Ozora!

13:32.605 --> 13:33.905
Stop this, Rockaku!

13:34.245 --> 13:35.145
Bro!

13:35.175 --> 13:36.645
Shut up!

13:36.975 --> 13:40.015
You're the legendary warrior, right?

13:40.015 --> 13:41.385
You're strong, right?

13:41.385 --> 13:43.905
Then how about we have a fight?

13:44.015 --> 13:47.955
Uh, but we don't have a reason to,
so I really don't think we should...

13:48.185 --> 13:51.155
A reason to fight?

13:52.525 --> 13:53.755
Roger!

13:55.635 --> 13:56.795
Don't move.

13:57.195 --> 13:58.525
M-Maiko!

13:59.505 --> 14:01.005
What're you doing?!

14:01.005 --> 14:03.065
Now you've got a reason to fight!

14:03.475 --> 14:04.195
Huh?

14:04.805 --> 14:07.745
This little punk
is supposed to be the chosen warrior?

14:07.745 --> 14:09.075
You've got to be kidding!

14:09.075 --> 14:11.205
What was the elder thinking?!

14:11.615 --> 14:13.945
I'm gonna be the one
to enter the Dragonic Heaven!

14:14.515 --> 14:17.975
If you want to save the girl,
you're gonna have to fight me, Reiji Ozora!

14:18.315 --> 14:19.755
B-But...

14:19.955 --> 14:21.795
I've got no use for weaklings!

14:21.795 --> 14:23.585
I'm going to go wild
at the Dragonic Heaven...

14:24.825 --> 14:30.325
...and show everyone in the world
how strong Master Rockaku is!

14:33.835 --> 14:35.205
There's no other way.

14:35.205 --> 14:36.295
Let's fight, Chibi!

14:36.575 --> 14:38.535
Ensui, look!

14:44.045 --> 14:47.035
So he's started it up. That idiot!

14:57.395 --> 14:58.415
Chibi!

14:58.665 --> 15:00.495
What's this supposed to be?!

15:00.495 --> 15:02.695
Is that all the guardian god can do?!

15:05.865 --> 15:08.895
That's funny.
Chibi's not acting like himself.

15:09.705 --> 15:11.225
What's the matter, Chibi?

15:12.275 --> 15:13.445
You're weak!

15:13.445 --> 15:15.035
You're too weak!

15:22.955 --> 15:24.285
Get out of here, Chibi!

15:34.265 --> 15:35.225
A direct hit!

15:35.995 --> 15:38.705
What the hell was that supposed to be?!

15:38.705 --> 15:40.635
I'll take you out of your misery.

15:42.735 --> 15:45.105
Why aren't you doing as I say, Chibi?

15:47.745 --> 15:50.215
We could've avoided that hit
if we'd jumped up!

15:50.415 --> 15:53.075
Don't you care if we get finished off, Chibi?!

15:56.315 --> 15:58.755
Chibi, can't you move your arms?

16:01.725 --> 16:05.655
You couldn't move your arms,
so that's why... that's why...

16:07.895 --> 16:08.895
Chibi!

16:08.895 --> 16:10.725
This is the end!

16:27.815 --> 16:28.645
Reiji!

16:29.085 --> 16:32.285
After two direct hits
from Master Rockaku's special attack...

16:32.855 --> 16:36.155
...even the great Senkohcoola
won't be able to get up.

16:36.495 --> 16:40.155
You couldn't handle Senkohcoola properly,
and you call yourself a warrior?

16:40.725 --> 16:43.895
Why do you want to enter
the Dragonic Heaven, anyway?

16:44.265 --> 16:46.165
You don't really have a reason, do you?

16:46.505 --> 16:49.835
You think you're some kind of savior
because everyone's flattering you?

16:50.035 --> 16:52.335
You sure are a piece of work.

16:52.705 --> 16:55.475
And Senkohcoola sure was disappointing.

16:55.815 --> 16:58.175
I never thought it would be such a weakling!

16:58.545 --> 17:00.305
Some guardian god he turned out to be!

17:00.945 --> 17:03.115
Don't you dare make fun of Chibi.

17:03.585 --> 17:04.715
What?

17:04.715 --> 17:06.355
Me and Chibi...

17:06.355 --> 17:08.375
...we've always fought together.

17:09.155 --> 17:12.715
Chibi is my precious friend!

17:13.165 --> 17:16.195
We've fought hard
in order to become strong together!

17:16.195 --> 17:17.325
He's my friend!

17:20.935 --> 17:23.265
It might be just as you say.

17:23.305 --> 17:26.235
I don't really have a purpose in fighting.

17:26.405 --> 17:29.015
I don't know what's true and what's not.

17:29.015 --> 17:32.445
I don't know what to believe in at all.

17:35.245 --> 17:37.385
H-He's gotten up!

17:37.385 --> 17:41.215
All I wanted was to become stronger,
together with Chibi.

17:41.885 --> 17:46.325
If going to the Dragonic Heaven
answers just one of my questions...

17:47.225 --> 17:48.795
...then we have to go!

17:48.795 --> 17:50.855
That's why I'm going to the tournament!

17:53.835 --> 17:56.305
You little greenhorn!

17:56.535 --> 17:58.005
Just stay out of it, kid!

17:58.375 --> 18:00.505
Lightning Wave!

18:00.775 --> 18:01.465
What?!

18:25.365 --> 18:28.195
That dragon is some kind of a monster,
Master Rockaku!

18:28.665 --> 18:31.035
My poison darts couldn't keep him down!

18:31.905 --> 18:34.035
Now we'll just have to get the kid!

18:34.175 --> 18:35.765
Poison?!

18:41.015 --> 18:44.285
I have nothing against you personally,
but this is for Master Rockaku!

18:46.385 --> 18:48.255
Just try it if you can!

18:48.555 --> 18:52.685
Even if my body gets ripped to pieces,
I'll still make it to the Dragonic Heaven!

18:54.425 --> 18:55.825
You asked for it!

18:58.265 --> 19:00.665
Stop it!

19:05.605 --> 19:06.905
M-Master Rockaku!

19:07.705 --> 19:10.745
Don't interfere without my permission!

19:10.745 --> 19:12.115
I-I'm sorry!

19:12.215 --> 19:13.445
Sorry about that.

19:13.445 --> 19:15.885
My underling shouldn't have done that.

19:15.885 --> 19:16.875
Damn!

19:17.055 --> 19:18.045
Rockaku.

19:18.925 --> 19:20.825
You're strong.

19:21.255 --> 19:25.285
It seems that you're not the boy
I thought you were.

19:25.765 --> 19:28.125
You're a solid man!

19:28.265 --> 19:30.755
You've sobered me up, that's for sure.

19:32.635 --> 19:34.155
You'd better win.

19:34.565 --> 19:35.555
All right?

19:37.335 --> 19:37.805
Y-Yes.

19:38.305 --> 19:42.475
Uh, could you tell me the real reason
you wanted to be in the tournament?

19:46.115 --> 19:47.845
Don't ask me stupid questions.

19:48.245 --> 19:50.745
It's because I'm strong, of course.

19:51.255 --> 19:52.245
Really?

19:52.625 --> 19:54.055
Is that really all it was?

19:56.925 --> 19:59.585
And I want to claim revenge.

19:59.825 --> 20:00.955
Revenge?

20:01.165 --> 20:03.995
Well, if you're the one going, what can I do?

20:04.265 --> 20:06.255
I'll think of some other plan.

20:09.805 --> 20:10.825
What is it?

20:11.405 --> 20:12.635
All right!

20:13.005 --> 20:15.495
Will you come to the Dragonic Heaven
and fight alongside me?

20:16.975 --> 20:18.745
I mean, it's team play, right?

20:19.245 --> 20:21.075
What would be the problem?

20:22.615 --> 20:24.175
I look forward to it, Mr. Rockaku!

20:32.565 --> 20:33.785
I like you!

20:34.595 --> 20:35.865
I like you, kid!

20:35.865 --> 20:37.195
Reiji, was it?!

20:37.195 --> 20:39.185
I'll be counting on you, kid!

20:40.035 --> 20:41.505
Today's been a great day!

20:44.335 --> 20:45.325
So...

20:45.905 --> 20:49.105
...where does that put me?
- Uh, hello. Nice to meet you.

20:54.345 --> 20:56.335
Boozing and fighting.

20:56.985 --> 21:00.655
As long as you are willing
to refrain from those two activities...

21:00.655 --> 21:03.455
...I will let you go to the Dragonic Heaven.

21:03.625 --> 21:05.925
I will, I will, I promise I will!

21:05.925 --> 21:08.295
But you're drinking as you say that!

21:08.795 --> 21:10.055
It'll be a rough road ahead.

21:12.565 --> 21:13.555
Reiji Ozora.

21:14.235 --> 21:15.165
Uh, yes!

21:15.165 --> 21:17.005
I'm glad you've made your decision.

21:17.635 --> 21:20.035
I'm counting on you for the Dragonite.

21:20.375 --> 21:23.315
Now that I've decided,
I guess I'll just have to come through.

21:23.315 --> 21:24.505
Right, Chibi?

21:25.685 --> 21:26.915
Yo, babe!

21:26.915 --> 21:28.545
Sorry about that incident before.

21:28.815 --> 21:30.805
Let's be good friends.

21:32.085 --> 21:35.145
- Let go of Maiko Yukino!
- A rough road indeed.

21:36.855 --> 21:42.025
- I'm never going to let her go!
- No, really, let me go!

21:56.045 --> 21:58.775
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.775 --> 22:01.545
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.545 --> 22:05.505
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.955 --> 22:09.725
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.725 --> 22:11.915
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.365 --> 22:16.495
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.895 --> 22:20.565
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.565 --> 22:23.305
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.305 --> 22:27.295
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.605 --> 22:31.115
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.115 --> 22:34.115
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.115 --> 22:39.015
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.655 --> 22:42.395
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.395 --> 22:45.155
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.155 --> 22:49.825
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.535 --> 22:53.305
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.305 --> 22:55.975
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.975 --> 23:00.635
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.275 --> 23:05.805
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.715 --> 23:12.415
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.885 --> 23:17.415
Next Episode

23:17.625 --> 23:18.395
All right!

23:18.395 --> 23:20.265
We're going to the Dragonic Heaven!

23:20.265 --> 23:21.955
Let's do our best, Chibi!

23:22.125 --> 23:24.565
Huh? Where did Chibi go?

23:24.895 --> 23:25.705
Huh?!

23:25.705 --> 23:30.175
He's been captured by mean-looking twins
who're forcing him to do tricks in the sea?!

23:30.175 --> 23:31.195
But why?!

23:32.645 --> 23:36.505
What? And those twins are also taking part
in the Dragonic Heaven?!

23:36.915 --> 23:40.005
Next time on Dragon Drive,
"The Fight Begins".

23:41.445 --> 23:41.885
Those twins look pretty tough!

23:41.885 --> 23:44.445
The Fight Begins
Those twins look pretty tough!
